          "segmentId": "m00287:alt:fig-00001-alt",
          "text": "The Michael addition of 3-buten-2-one and ethyl acetoacetate in the presence of sodium ethoxide forming Michael product (intermediate). Further aldol reaction, in presence of sodium ethoxide, yields ethyl-2-methyl-4-oxocyclohex-2-enecarboxylate (annulation product)."
