        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00287:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "The Michael addition of alpha-beta unsaturated ketone (acceptor) with beta-diketone (donor) in base gives intermediate (Michael product). Subsequent reactions give Robinson annulation product, which undergoes multiple reactions to form estrone."
